The '''line of succession to the [[King of Qym|Qymish throne]]''' is based on the [[Fundamental Law of Qym]]. At present, only direct male-line males of at least {{abbr|30|25 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} and under {{abbr|75|62 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} years of age are allowed to ascend the throne. 

